, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3035\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8E%89%E6%8B%89%E5%A6%AE\" title=\"莉拉妮\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8E%89%E6%8B%89%E5%A6%AE\" title=\"莉拉妮\"><img alt=\"莉拉妮\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-303501.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-303501.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-303501.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8E%89%E6%8B%89%E5%A6%AE\" title=\"莉拉妮\">莉拉妮</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.3</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>南地漫游记</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：303502</div></div></div></div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"303502\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303504.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d6/Belonging-303504.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\"><div class=\"line-1\">“轻松旅途”\n</div><div class=\"line-2\">便携登山杖</div><div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">EasyGo Alpenstock</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />45<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一组轻便结实的四节登山杖，受访者登山用品储备中的一对。<br />受访者热情地介绍了它的性能，并邀请我欣赏她的登山鞋、冲浪板、弓箭……最终我不得不礼貌地要求暂停。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303505.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a3/Belonging-303505.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\"><div class=\"line-1\">“攀登之爪”10mm\n</div><div class=\"line-2\">户外登山绳</div><div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Clawbing 10mm Climbing Rope</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />15.3<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>编入了跳跃豪猪鬃毛的畅销登山绳，价格平实，坚固耐用。每个攀登者都知道，绳索是自己的生命所系。检查登山绳时，受访者露出了难得的严肃神情。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303506.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/de/Belonging-303506.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">扎染方巾<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Bandhani Kerchief</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />3<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一条本地扎染方巾，由受访者在山脚下购置。准备登山之前，她曾在染布工坊花掉了整整一个下午，以期大显身手。最终，她选择购买成品，但依旧兴致不减。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%BF%9C%E5%B3%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B81.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 远峰的巡游1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%BF%9C%E5%B3%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B81.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%BF%9C%E5%B3%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B81.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%BF%9C%E5%B3%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B81.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%BF%9C%E5%B3%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B81.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%BF%9C%E5%B3%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B81.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%BF%9C%E5%B3%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B81.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%BF%9C%E5%B3%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B82.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 远峰的巡游2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%BF%9C%E5%B3%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B82.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%BF%9C%E5%B3%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B82.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%BF%9C%E5%B3%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B82.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%BF%9C%E5%B3%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B82.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%BF%9C%E5%B3%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B82.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%BF%9C%E5%B3%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A1%E6%B8%B82.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">远峰的巡游 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Adventure on The Mountains</small></span></span>"}}